From: WL2GO
Subject: Bump golang.org/x/net to v0.60.0

v0.38.0 carries advisories reachable from Pat's HTTP client and server paths
(govulncheck: GO-2026-5026, GO-2026-6603, GO-2026-6610, GO-2026-6611,
GO-2026-6612, GO-2026-6617). x/sys and x/term move with it, and the module's
go directive rises to 1.26.0, which x/net v0.60.0 requires.
